WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.735
COALESCE returns the first non-null expression Here
we try cleaned

00:00:05.761 --> 00:00:11.990
email first then cleaned phone then a text label
saying no contact method This

00:00:12.016 --> 00:00:17.653
is a reporting or business-logic fallback It does
not repair the missing

00:00:17.679 --> 00:00:23.291
email or phone The source still has the same
missingness we are simply

00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:25.370
choosing a value for the current output
